/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a82aeed5bdc69b04.png\" />元。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":15,"qid":"2139524","tag":"综合","type":"single","stem":"若有人持有1000股大商股份，那么他需要持有约_______金龙汽车的股份才能与此收益相当。","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"3500股"},{"k":"B","t":"2000股"},{"k":"C","t":"2900股"},{"k":"D","t":"3000股"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题干所求“若有人持有1000股大商股份，那么他需要持有约_______金龙汽车的股份才能与此收益相当”，材料给出两公司股份的每股收益，可判定此题为平均数问题。定位表格，大商股份每股收益0.90元，金龙汽车每股0.31元。与1000股大商股份收益相当，需要持有金龙汽车股份<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9deb20e244705e00.png\" />股，C项最接近。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"}]},{"material":"<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/16081e9f6b37754.jpg\" /></p>","qs":[{"n":16,"qid":"2139532","tag":"增长","type":"single","stem":"B年全民所有制单位职工劳保福利费比A年增加了：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"279亿元"},{"k":"B","t":"669亿元"},{"k":"C","t":"49亿元"},{"k":"D","t":"39亿元"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>由题干“B年······比A年增加了”，且选项单位为亿元，可判定本题为增长量计算问题。定位图形材料1可知，A年全民所有制单位职工劳保福利费为27.9亿元，B年为66.9亿元。根据公式<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-397c65d140ebd7d4.png\" />，B年全民所有制单位职工劳保福利费比A年增加了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5788cd43a1dcc10a.png\" />亿元。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":17,"qid":"2139538","tag":"综合","type":"single","stem":"C年全民所有制单位职工医疗费为：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"335.5亿元"},{"k":"B","t":"158.4亿元"},{"k":"C","t":"68.8亿元"},{"k":"D","t":"20.5亿元"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题干所求“C年······医疗费”，结合图形材料2，可判定此题为现期比重问题。定位图形材料1，C年全民所有制单位职工劳保福利费为335.5亿元；定位图形材料2，C年医疗费所占比重为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f9c4043abbd4fb3c.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-cc3853e8ed4146f7.png\" />，则C年全民所有制单位职工医疗费为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f28f154476747645.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2814201b02d26103.png\" />，与C项最接近。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":18,"qid":"2139544","tag":"增长","type":"single","stem":"全民所有制单位职工B年工资总额比A年上涨了：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9cd9ae32ca713cf3.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b1574d06cf58e464.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1e80fdde6f0be225.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d485e4a7b974cc8c.png\" /></p>"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题干所求“······B年比A年上涨了······”，且选项为百分数，可判定此题为一般增长率问题。定位图形材料1，A年全民所有制单位职工劳保福利费为27.9亿元，占工资总额的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9b47a108156a6c82.png\" />，故A年工资总额为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-db67164b37433162.png\" />；B年为66.9亿元，占工资总额的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-71bebe546a331808.png\" />，故B年工资总额为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-58ae8287369f9140.png\" />。根据增长率计算公式<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f3489457613dcc9f.png\" />，可计算出，全民所有制单位职工B年工资总额比A年上涨了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-bb7f84b54620970c.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-07616e333194fee0.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":19,"qid":"2139548","tag":"综合","type":"single","stem":"全民所有制单位职工劳保福利费在B年用于医疗费用的支出比用于其他费用的支出多：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"20.3亿元"},{"k":"B","t":"14.25亿元"},{"k":"C","t":"13.58亿元"},{"k":"D","t":"31.8亿元"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题干所求“B年用于医疗费用的支出比用于其他费用的支出多”，结合图形材料2所给的职工劳保福利费构成，可判定此题为现期比重问题。定位图形材料1，B年全民所有制单位职工劳保福利费为66.9亿元；定位图形材料2，B年医疗费所占比重为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b5e02939ce7c1fbe.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-fde7358a1a6f8a54.png\" />。可得，B年用于医疗费用的支出为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2d4fb429f29fa683.png\" />，用于其他费用的支出为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c87c4035f7fa0515.png\" />。从而可计算出，B年用于医疗费用的支出比用于其他费用的支出多<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ac1de12740b4dab2.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d1817339fe58cad4.png\" />亿元。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":20,"qid":"2139556","tag":"综合","type":"single","stem":"下列说法中，错误的是：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p>A年全民所有制单位职工劳保福利费占工资总额的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9b47a108156a6c82.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p>C年全民所有制单位职工工资总额为1290.4亿元</p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p>C年全民所有制单位职工劳保福利费中，离退休费所占比重比B年增加了19.7个百分点</p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p>全民所有制单位职工B年工资总额比C年劳保福利费低</p>"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>A项：定位图形材料1，A年全民所有制单位职工劳保福利费占工资总额的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9b47a108156a6c82.png\" />，正确；</p><p>B项：定位图形材料1，C年全民所有制单位职工工资总额为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-112b01b3cc839e0e.png\" />亿元，正确；</p><p>C项：定位图形材料2，C年离退休费所占比重比B年增加了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2cc9f5d526acef78.png\" />，即增加了19.7个百分点，正确；</p><p>D项：定位图形材料1，B年工资总额<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6a9143d89a3fa66f.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9b74cf99d7ef1e04.png\" />，错误。</p><p>本题为选非题，故正确答案为D。</p>"}]}]}